[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     69[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Every row is exercised with many randomized inputs (fixed-seed PRNG in
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     70[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `tests/common/mod.rs`, `ITERS` per row) unless the row is a fixed literal
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     71[0m:[38;5;10m[49m configuration, in which case the randomization goes into the *ignored* argument
